meta {
  name: Overview - Get
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/:workspace/billing
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  workspace: {{workspaceId}}
}

docs {
  Single aggregate read for a billing settings screen: the active
  subscription (with its plan, or `null` if never subscribed), any
  non-subscription entitlement, and the current usage period's credit
  balance. Requires the `billing.view` permission.

  Render `current_plan` as "the plan you are on". A workspace can be
  entitled by a subscription, by a `plan_grant` (a lifetime purchase, which
  has no subscription at all), or by both at once — in which case the more
  generous of the two applies, so neither field alone is the answer.
  `plan_grant` is `null` unless such a grant is active.

  Transaction history and credit-pack purchases live on their own paginated
  endpoints (`Billing/Credits - List`, `Billing/Credit Packs - List Purchased`).

  Response is wrapped: `{ success, statusCode, message, data: {
  subscription, plan_grant, current_plan, usage_period, topup_credits,
  credits_available } }`. `usage_period.credits_remaining` is `null` when
  the plan is unlimited.
}
